    <generalfeedback format="html"><text><![CDATA[<p>The lesion's new size of 15 mm has crossed the 10 mm threshold, which is what warrants diagnostic imaging. Growth alone would not independently trigger imaging if the lesion remained under 10 mm.</p>]]></text></generalfeedback>
