    <name><text>Q018</text></name>
    <questiontext format="html"><text><![CDATA[<p>A 44-year-old with schistosomal periportal fibrosis and splenomegaly, no cirrhosis and no HBV. Adequate study, no focal lesion. The appropriate recommendation is:</p>]]></text></questiontext>
